Language models
---------------

Gemma 4 (E2B, E4B, and 12B)
  Google DeepMind, as 4-bit MLX conversions from mlx-community
  Refine, document edits, vocabulary suggestions, and meeting notes. Downloaded when you pick one.
  License: Apache-2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
  https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/core/model_card_4

Apple Foundation Models
  Apple
  Refine on Macs with Apple Intelligence turned on. The model comes with macOS; SideWave downloads nothing for it.
  License: Part of macOS
  https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundationmodels


